OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FReform UK Deputy Leader Richard Tice
OL,8,Fhas urged people concerned about
OL,9,Fglobal warming to stop focussing on
OL,10,Fthe "doom and gloom", as it could see
OL,11,Fan improvement in English wine.
OL,13,FTice acknowledged climate change is
OL,14,F"real" but said there was no proof net
OL,15,Fzero policies would halt it ` and to
OL,16,Fthink it can be stopped is "arrogant".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FInstead, Tice suggested the public
OL,8,Fshould enjoy it when it gets warm,
OL,9,Fadding: "If it means that English wine
OL,10,Fand sparkling wine gets better and
OL,11,Fbetter, fantastic."
OL,13,FIn July, the Met Office said that
OL,14,F2,700 people are thought to have died
OL,15,Ffrom heat-related causes during the
OL,16,FMay and June heatwaves in England and
OL,17,FWales.
OL,19,FOf those, they estimated that 42%
OL,20,F"died as a result of the extra heat
OL,21,Fcaused by human-induced warming".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FWhen asked on Monday whether he
OL,8,Fbelieves climate change is real and
OL,9,Fwhat the solution is, Tice said: "Of
OL,10,Fcourse climate change is real, but
OL,11,Fwhere is the evidence that net zero is
OL,12,Fgoing to stop it? Where is the
OL,13,Fevidence? There isn't any.
OL,15,F"Climate change has always happened,
OL,16,Fit always will. Maybe the smarter
OL,17,Fthing to do is to adapt to it,
OL,18,F(rather) than think arrogantly you can
OL,19,Fstop it."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FTice added: "I think when it's a bit
OL,8,Fwarm, let's enjoy it. And if it means
OL,9,Fthat English wine and sparkling wine
OL,10,Fgets better and better, fantastic.
OL,11,FThat means we can take on the French,
OL,12,Ffantastic.
OL,14,F"Let's celebrate some of these things
OL,15,Frather than just be sort of doom and
OL,16,Fgloom about it."
OL,18,FHis comments, however, have been
OL,19,Fcondemned by some climate change
OL,20,Fcampaigners, accusing him of being
OL,21,F"out of touch with the public".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FAmy Cameron, Greenpeace UK's programme
OL,8,Fdirector, said: "Tice's words show
OL,9,Fthat a party bankrolled by fossil fuel
OL,10,Finterests will keep denying the
OL,11,Fclimate crisis for its funders'
OL,12,Fbenefit even when its impacts are
OL,13,Fundeniable.
OL,15,F"Reform should try telling nurses
OL,16,Ffainting on shifts, farmers losing
OL,17,Ftheir crops and people running from
OL,18,Fburning homes to enjoy the hot weather
OL,19,Fand see what reaction they'll get.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,F"There's only one way to stop this
OL,8,Fextreme weather: cutting emissions
OL,9,Ffrom fossil fuels. Things will only
OL,10,Fget from bad to worse if we listen to
OL,11,Fthe politicians being paid to deny
OL,12,Fit's even happening."
OL,14,FJames Sutton, Co-CEO of climate
OL,15,Fcampaign group Zero Hour, said:
OL,16,F"Richard Tice's comments are
OL,17,Fcompletely out of touch with the
OL,18,Fpublic.
OL,26,@xD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,F"Politicians have a duty to citizens,
OL,8,Fand we need politicians who will stand
OL,9,Fup and help protect communities, not
OL,10,Fbelittle their summer from hell."
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FMinister for Women and Equalities
OL,18,FBridget Phillipson also joined
OL,19,Fcriticism of Tice, describing his
OL,20,Fcomments as "tone deaf".
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
