OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,F"Wildfires are affecting people's
OL,8,Flives," she said. "Drought threatens
OL,9,Four water supplies and food security.
OL,10,FAll the while, Richard Tice is having
OL,11,Fa laugh.
OL,13,F"These comments raise serious
OL,14,Fquestions about his judgement and
OL,15,Fexpose where Reform UK's interests
OL,16,Freally lie."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FDespite the criticism, Tice doubled
OL,8,Fdown on his comments in an interview
OL,9,Fon TalkTV, saying: "Where we have a
OL,10,Fray of sunshine I think we should
OL,11,Fcelebrate it."
OL,13,F"However, of course, the fires and the
OL,14,Fterrible damage to those houses is
OL,15,Fabsolutely horrific," he added. "We
OL,16,Fall know that, that doesn't actually
OL,17,Fneed stating because it is so
OL,18,Fblindingly obvious."
OL,26,@wD@UO]wD@aOUzD@TO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
