OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787093266
OL,3,CReform's Tice faces backlash for
OL,4,Csaying climate change not all 'doom
OL,5,Cand gloom'
OL,7,FTice argued that if there is "anybody
OL,8,Fwho arrogantly thinks that humans can
OL,9,Fstop the power of the sun", then
OL,10,F"frankly they are the ones who are
OL,11,Fcompletely out of touch".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
